msgid "Usage: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\nClick mouse buttons.\n\nOptions:\n  -r, --repeat=N             Repeat entire sequence N times\n  -D, --next-delay=N         Delay N milliseconds between input events (up/down,                                a complete click means doubled time)\n  -P, --press-release        Press & release mouse button to complete a click, (optional)\n  -h, --help                 Display this help and exit\n\nHow to specify buttons:\n  Now all mouse buttons are represented using hexadecimal numeric values, with an optional\nbit mask to specify if mouse up/down needs to be omitted.\n  0x00 - LEFT\n  0x01 - RIGHT\n  0x02 - MIDDLE\n  0x03 - SIDE\n  0x04 - EXTR\n  0x05 - FORWARD\n  0x06 - BACK\n  0x07 - TASK\n  0x40 - Mouse down\n  0x80 - Mouse up\n  Examples:\n    0x00: chooses left button, but does nothing (you can use this to implement extra sleeps)\n    0xC0: left button click (down then up)\n    0x41: right button down\n    0x82: middle button up\n  The '0x' prefix can be omitted if you want.\n"
msgstr "Defnydd: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\nCliciwch fotymau'r llygoden.\n\nDewisiadau:\n  -r, --repeat=N             Ailadroddwch y dilyniant cyfan N o weithiau\n  -D, --next-delay=N         Oedwch N milieiliad rhwng digwyddiadau mewnbwn (i lawr/i fyny,                                mae clic cyflawn yn cymryd dwywaith cymaint)\n  -P, --press-release        Pwyswch a rhyddhewch fotwm y llygoden i gwblhau clic (dewisol)\n  -h, --help                 Dangoswch y cymorth hwn a gorffen\n\nSut i nodi botymau:\n  Cynrychiolir pob botwm llygoden bellach gan werth rhifol hecsadegol, gyda mwgwd didau dewisol\ni nodi a ddylid hepgor digwyddiad llygoden i lawr/i fyny.\n  0x00 - LEFT\n  0x01 - RIGHT\n  0x02 - MIDDLE\n  0x03 - SIDE\n  0x04 - EXTR\n  0x05 - FORWARD\n  0x06 - BACK\n  0x07 - TASK\n  0x40 - Llygoden i lawr\n  0x80 - Llygoden i fyny\n  Enghreifftiau:\n    0x00: yn dewis y botwm chwith, ond nid yw'n gwneud dim (gallwch ddefnyddio hyn i weithredu seibiannau ychwanegol)\n    0xC0: clic botwm chwith (i lawr ac yna i fyny)\n    0x41: botwm dde i lawr\n    0x82: botwm canol i fyny\n  Gallwch hepgor y rhagddodiad '0x' os dymunwch.\n"

